# Transcribed from Movy's browser-test/logic/automation.mjs at 9190e79
# (github.com/DimaDake/schwung-movy, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 megadake;
# engines/third_party/movy/LICENSE) to the FM-1's panel (docs/15 S8).
# Its "tap-to-clear": Movy clears a held step's lock with a knob touched and
# let go unturned (`aclrs 0 0 4`). The FM-1's knobs have no touch, so it is
# SHIFT and one detent of that knob (docs/15 §3.9); SHIFT's release then
# clears no notes.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--key 0.10:7:100:0.8
--turn 0.20:SELECT:1
--turn 0.25:SELECT:1
--turn 0.30:KNOB3:1
--button 0.40:SEL:0.2
--turn 0.50:KNOB3:1
--button 1.00:PLAY/STOP
